<title>FRANCE: Arthuis says no doubt EMU to start on time.</title>
<headline>Arthuis says no doubt EMU to start on time.</headline>
<dateline>LYON, France 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>French Finance Minister Jean Arthuis said on Wednesday there was no doubt European economic and monetary union would start on time in January 1999.</p>
<p>&quot;The timetable for Economic and Monetary Union will be respected. I have no doubt about that,&quot; he told a news conference after a meeting with German Finance Minister Theo Waigel and the central bank heads of France and Germany.</p>
</text>
